# HK Transport Department scrapers (passenger journeys, private car fleet
# stock, net growth): commit the time series, same reasoning as
# airline_traffic above -- these are re-scraped in full each run (no
# incremental fetch), so an unignored-but-uncommitted copy would silently
# vanish from a fresh checkout with no missing-cache caveat anywhere in the
# builder that reads them.
!data/processed/transport/
data/processed/transport/*
!data/processed/transport/*.parquet

